:46 +08:00\">9h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>试一下本地的 4K 视频。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17912670\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/faad7ab8d0e191000ca0c4c716fba33e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"farah9\" data-uid=\"436868\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/farah9\">farah9</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 15:21:14 +08:00\">9h 15m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5k 165hz 路过，你的显示器和线太垃圾了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17912783\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8e7a/7eb4/502418_normal.png?m=1742310719\" alt=\"LotusChuan\" data-uid=\"502418\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/LotusChuan\">LotusChuan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 15:40:57 +08:00\">8h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你用的 Safari ？我 M2 Max Mac Studio 看 b 站也卡，查了下发现是 M2 不支持 AV2 硬解码，Safari 又不支持软解。换成 Chrome 就正常了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17912978\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f2fc8434322e7ace37a4081e6e0ac301?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kofjerrylee\" data-uid=\"266822\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <stron