><a href=\"/member/dilidilid\">dilidilid</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 19:26:53 +08:00\">5h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>M4 不可能带不动 4K 的，你说的得是上古的 Intel 集显了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17913855\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ae1d/2c2d/2987_normal.png?m=1779291222\" alt=\"nicoljiang\" data-uid=\"2987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nicoljiang\">nicoljiang</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 20:15:54 +08:00\">4h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>b 站的视频特别耗电，ytb 也明显特别省电</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17913874\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/63f6/019c/26842_normal.png?m=1730423863\" alt=\"Radeon\" data-uid=\"26842\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Radeon\">Radeon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 20:28:37 +08:00\">4h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>用 Safari 不要用 Chrome 。这是因为 B 站默认用 H.265 ，但是 Chrome 因为版权没有内置硬件解码器，或者这样设置：</p><p>在 B 站任何视频播放页，点击播放器右下角的\"齿轮\"图标，进入\"更多播放设置\"。在\"优先选择\"中，将编码格式从默认的 \"HEVC\" 切换为 \"AVC\" 。这样，Chrome 就能用其完美支持的 AVC 编码进行硬解，CPU 占用率会立刻降下来。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914281\">\n        \n        <table>\n     